ergy_Cold_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Protection_from_Energy:_Cold\" title=\"Protection from Energy: Cold\">Protection from Energy: Cold</a></li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Protection_from_Energy:_Fire\" title=\"Protection from Energy: Fire\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/4/49/Protection_from_Energy_Fire_Icon.webp/40px-Protection_from_Energy_Fire_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/4/49/Protection_from_Energy_Fire_Icon.webp/60px-Protection_from_Energy_Fire_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/4/49/Protection_from_Energy_Fire_Icon.webp/80px-Protection_from_Energy_Fire_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Protection from Energy: Fire\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/4/49/Protection_from_Energy_Fire_Icon.webp/40px-Protection_from_Energy_Fire_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"40\" height=\"40\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/4/49/Protection_from_Energy_Fire_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Protection_from_Energy:_Fire\" title=\"Protection from Energy: Fire\">Protection from Energy: Fire</a></li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Protection_from_Energy:_Lightning\" title=\"Protection from Energy: Lightning\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/6/6d/Protection_from_Energy_Lightning_Icon.webp/40px-Protection_from_Energy_Lightning_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/6/6d/Protection_from_Energy_Lightning_Icon.webp/60px-Protection_from_Energy_Lightning_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/6/6d/Protection_from_Energy_Lightning_Icon.webp/80px-Protection_from_Energy_Lightning_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Protection from Energy: Lightning\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/6/6d/Protection_from_Energy_Lightning_Icon.webp/40px-Protection_from_Energy_Lightning_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"40\" height=\"40\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/6/6d/Protection_from_Energy_Lightning_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Protection_from_Energy:_Lightning\" title=\"Protection from Energy: Lightning\">Protection from Energy: Lightning</a></li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Protection_from_Energy:_Thunder\" title=\"Protection from Energy: Thunder\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/a/a9/Protection_from_Energy_Thunder_Icon.webp/40px-Protection_from_Energy_Thunder_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/a/a9/Protection_from_Energy_Thunder_Icon.webp/60px-Protection_from_Energy_Thunder_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/a/a9/Protection_from_Energy_Thunder_Icon.webp/80px-Protection_from_Energy_Thunder_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Protection from Energy: Thunder\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/a/a9/Protection_from_Energy_Thunder_Icon.webp/40px-Protection_from_Energy_Thunder_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"40\" height=\"40\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/a/a9/Protection_from_Energy_Thunder_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Protection_from_Energy:_Thunder\" title=\"Protection from Energy: Thunder\">Protection from Energy: Thunder</a></li>\n</ul>\n</div><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"How_to_learn\"> How to learn </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\nClasses: <ul><li> Class level 5: <a href=\"/wiki/Cleric\" title=\"Cleric\">Cleric</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Druid\" title=\"Druid\">Druid</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Sorcerer\" title=\"Sorcerer\">Sorcerer</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Wizard\" title=\"Wizard\">Wizard</a>, and <a href=\"/wiki/Circle_of_the_Land\" title=\"Circle of the Land\">Circle of the Land</a> (Desert)</li><li> Class level 9: <a href=\"/wiki/Ranger\" title=\"Ranger\">Ranger</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Oath_of_the_Ancients\" title=\"Oath of the Ancients\">Oath of the Ancients</a>, and <a href=\"/wiki/Oath_of_Vengeance\" title=\"Oath of Vengeance\">Oath of Vengeance</a></li></ul>\n<p>Other ways to learn:<br>\n</p>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Wizard\" title=\"Wizard\">Wizards</a> with <span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon nowrap\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/e/ef/Spell_Slot_Icon.png/20px-Spell_Slot_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/e/ef/Spell_Slot_Icon.png/30px-Spell_Slot_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/e/ef/Spell_Slot_Icon.png 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/e/ef/Spell_Slot_Icon.png/20px-Spell_Slot_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/e/ef/Spell_Slot_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Spells#Spell_slots\" title=\"Spells\">Level 3 Spell Slots</a> can <a href=\"/wiki/Transcribing_scrolls\" title=\"Transcribing scrolls\">transcribe</a> a <span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-itemicon bg3wiki-itemicon-rare\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Scroll_of_Protection_from_Energy\" title=\"Scroll of Protection from Energy\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/4/49/Scroll_of_Protection_from_Energy_Unfaded_Icon.png/25px-Scroll_of_Protection_from_Energy_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/4/49/Scroll_of_Protection_from_Energy_Unfaded_Icon.png/38px-Scroll_of_Protection_from_Energy_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/4/49/Scroll_of_Protection_from_Energy_Unfaded_Icon.png/50px-Scroll_of_Protection_from_Energy_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/4/49/Scroll_of_Protection_from_Energy_Unfaded_Icon.png/25px-Scroll_of_Protection_from_Energy_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/4/49/Scroll_of_Protection_from_Energy_Unfaded_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Scroll_of_Protection_from_Energy\" title=\"Scroll of Protection from Energy\">Scroll of Protection from Energy</a> to their spellbooks.</li></ul>\n</div>  <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Visuals\"> Visuals </span></h2>\n<span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><div class=\"embedvideo-wrapper embedvideo--local-embed-style\" style=\"position: relative;\"><div class=\"embedvideo-localEmbedStyle\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><div class=\"embedvideo-overlay\"><div class=\"embedvideo-loader\"><div class=\"embedvideo-loader__fakeButton\">Play Video</div><div class=\"embedvideo-loader__footer\"><div class=\"embedvideo-loader__service\">Local File</div></div></div></div></div><video src=\"https://bg3.wiki/w/images/3/31/Protection_From_Energy_Visuals.mp4\" width=\"640\" height=\"360\" class=\"mw-file-element\" style=\"max-width: 100%; width: 640px; height: auto;\" controls=\"\"><a href=\"https://bg3.wiki/wiki/File:Protection_From_Energy_Visuals.mp4\">https://bg3.wiki/wiki/File:Protection_From_Energy_Visuals.mp4</a></video></div></span> \n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"External_links\">External links</span></h2>\n<ul><li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://forgottenrealms.fandom.com/wiki/Protection_from_energy\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/6/68/FRWiki_Icon.png/22px-FRWiki_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/6/68/FRWiki_Icon.png/33px-FRWiki_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/6/68/FRWiki_Icon.png/44px-FRWiki_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Protection from energy\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/6/68/FRWiki_Icon.png/22px-FRWiki_Icon.png.webp\